## Summary

This is a full-stack application using:
- **Backend**: Django + Django REST Framework
- **Frontend**: React with MobX for state management
- **Build System**: Nx monorepo with Webpack
- **Infrastructure**: Docker, PostgreSQL, Redis
- **Feature Flags**: LaunchDarkly
- **Task Queue**: RQ (Redis Queue)
- **UI Components**: Ant Design + Radix UI + Tailwind CSS

The architecture follows a monorepo pattern with separate frontend libraries (editor, datamanager, core) built with Nx and bundled with Webpack. Do not break usage of the frameworks being used when implementing new code. 